          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir oyunda can, skor ve düşmanlar gibi sistemler bulunur. Ayrıca güçlendiriciler ve seviyeler gibi yeni özellikler de ekleyebilirsin.</p><p>JavaScript'te de kütüphaneler var! Başkalarının yazdığı kodu ödünç alabilir ve başkalarının kullanması için kendi kodumuza katkıda bulunabiliriz.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Diğer kodlayıcılar yazdıkları kodun başkalarına yardımcı olabileceğini düşünebilir. JavaScript kütüphaneleri herkese açık kullanım için kod içerir.</p><p>Yararlı olabilmeleri için bu kütüphanelere erişilebilmelidir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kütüphaneler genellikle <code>Content Delivery Network (CDN)</code> üzerinde depolanır. <code>CDN</code>, web içeriğini yakındaki bir sunucudan sunarak hızlı bir şekilde ileten bir ağdır.</p><p>HTML dosyamızdaki <code>script</code> etiketinin <code>src</code> özniteliğine bir <code>CDN</code> ekleyerek kütüphaneyi kullanabiliriz.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game is loading...\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/gamekit.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>src</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>src</code> özniteliği, ardından bir <code>/</code> ve kütüphanenin adı gelen <code>CDN</code>'yi içerir. Aşağıdaki koddan <code>CDN</code>'yi ve kütüphaneyi belirle.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> CDN'dir ve <code>spritefx.js</code> kütüphanedir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> kütüphanedir ve <code>spritefx.js</code>, <code>CDN</code>'dir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> CDN'dir ve <code>spritefx.js</code> kütüphanedir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>spritefx.js</code> kütüphanesi, <code>\"player\"</code> kimliğine sahip bir öğenin sprite'ının sallanmasını sağlar. Bu örnekte <code>teach.getmimo.com</code> bizim <code>CDN</code>'imizdir.</p><p>Bir <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> etiketi ekle ve <code>src</code> özniteliği için doğru değeri ayarla.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"#player\" class=\"selector-id\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"40px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>script</code>, ardından <code>src</code> ve son olarak <code>\"https://mimo.org/spritefx.js\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
