      {
        "id": 17293,
        "title": "JS Kütüphaneleri",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kütüphaneler sayesinde, karşılaştığımız bir sorunu çözmek için başka birinin kodladığı çözümü kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Her kütüphane farklıdır. Bir kütüphane kullandığımızda, sağladığı fonksiyonları nasıl kullanacağımızı öğrenmek için belgelerine bakmamız gerekir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki belgelere göre, oyuncunun puanına puan eklemek için hangi fonksiyonu kullanmalıyız?</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   table,&#xA;   td {&#xA;    border: solid 1px black;&#xA;    border-collapse: collapse;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score Library&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Open-sourced library for basic score calculations in games.&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;table&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;addPoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to add points to the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;removePoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to remove points from the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;resetScore()&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to reset the score to 0&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;formatScore(score)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to format the score for the UI&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Version 3.1.0&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Added input handling to accept String values as parameter&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>removePoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>addLives(lives)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kütüphanelerdeki kodu kullanmak için dokümantasyonda fonksiyonu bulup ihtiyaç duyduğun yerde kullanmamız gerekir.</p><p><code>score.js</code> kütüphanesinde bulduğun fonksiyonu kullanarak <code>0</code> puanlık skora <code>50</code> puan eklemenin sonucunu göster.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/score.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>score</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>addPoints</code>, <code>(0, 50)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kullanabileceğimiz pek çok kütüphane var. Burada <code>state.js</code>, JavaScript kullanarak bir oyunun durumunu biçimlendirmemize ve görüntülememize olanak tanır.</p><p>Sence kodun hangi bölümünü <code>state.js</code> kütüphanesi sağlıyor?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stateLabel = state(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameover&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").format(\" /><text value=\"&quot;TITLE&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ui = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ui.innerHTML = stateLabel;\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Current Game State\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/state.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>format(\"TITLE\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>ui</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>format(\"TITLE\")</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146574,
